010-1227. \r\r Mayor Wolfson opened the public hearing.\r\r Anita Davidoo, Associate Engineer, presented the staff report.\r\r Mayor Wolfson closed the public hearing.\r\rCouncilmember Washburn moved, seconded by Councilmember Maurer, to adopt Resolution No. 2010-1227, to update the Public Works Fee Schedule to establish fixed fees and amend Resolution No. 91-52 for the review of plans and supporting documentation submitted to the Public Works Department; and to adopt Resolution No. 2010-1229, to establish these fees on an interim basis pending the effectiveness of Resolution 2010-1227. MOTION CARRIED 5/0.\r\r\r Adoption of Resolution 2010-1228, establishing Planning fees on an interim basis pending Resolution 2010-1225 becoming effective. \r\r Mayor Wolfson opened the public hearing.\r\r Mayor Wolfson closed the public hearing.\r\rCouncilmember Maurer moved, seconded by Councilmember Washburn, to adopt Resolution No. 2010-1228, establishing Planning fees on an interim basis pending Resolution 2010-1225 becoming effective. MOTION CARRIED 5/0.\r\r Review and discussion of the City�s annual Housing Element progress report. \r\r Mayor Wolfson opened the public hearing.\r\r Talyn Mirzakhanian, Planner, presented the staff report.\r\r Mayor Wolfson closed the public hearing.\r\r Councilmember Bozajian moved, seconded by Councilmember Washburn, to receive and file the City�s annual Housing Element progress report. MOTION CARRIED 5/0.\r\rUNFINISHED BUSINESS\r\r Inaugural annual report and updates of the City�s solid waste franchise cart, container and temporary collection service agreements. \r\rRobert Yalda, Public Works Director, and Daniel Pankau, Environmental Assistant, presented the staff report.\r\r There was no action taken.\r\r Presentation of Community Development Department�s Annual Report. \r\rMaureen Tamuri, Community Development Director, presented the staff report.\r\r There was no action taken.\r\r Discussion Regarding Method Fest Film Festival Compliance w